msgid "But as they have to bring it back to the Civic Center to deposit it, their gathering efficiency suffers from the distance. To fix that, we can build a Storehouse, a dropsite for wood, stone, and metal, close to the trees. To do so, select your five newly trained Citizen Soldiers and look for the construction panel on the bottom right, click on the Storehouse icon, move the mouse as close as possible to the trees you want to gather and click on a valid place to build the dropsite.\n"
